{{High Risk|Template:Scrollbox|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Wraps content in a fixed-height, '''scrollable box''' with an automatic scrollbar — handy for long lists, such as the "Affiliation and Collaboration Projects" sections, that would otherwise stretch a page. The content may be passed as the first unnamed parameter or as <code>content=</code>.

==Syntax==
{{T|Scrollbox|block=1
|v1=content =
|v2=height =
|v3=height-unit =
|v4=font-size =
|v5=min-width =
|v6=text-align =
|v7=class =
}}

==Examples==
{{T|Scrollbox|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=height = 60
|p2=content = Line 1<br/>Line 2<br/>Line 3<br/>Line 4<br/>Line 5<br/>Line 6<br/>Line 7<br/>Line 8
}}

